      48.03,
      223.78,
      469.51
    ],
    "text": "Report of the Auditor General :\u2013 Report on Review of the Balance Sheet of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka as at 31st October, 2019",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      200.6,
      162.03,
      208.9,
      203.3
    ],
    "text": "Introduction",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.76,
      162.03,
      196.9,
      786.04
    ],
    "text": "I have reviewed the accompanying Balance Sheet of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka as at 31st October, 2019. Management is Responsible for the preparation and presentation of this Balance Sheet. My responsibilityis to express a conclusion on this Balance Sheet based based on my review.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      166.76,
      162.03,
      175.06,
      214.59
    ],
    "text": "Scope of Review",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      124.76,
      162.03,
      163.06,
      786.13
    ],
    "text": "I conducted my review in accordance with Sri Lanka Standard on Review Engagements 2410, Review of Interim Financial Information Performed by the Independent Auditor of the Entity. A review of the BalanceSheet consists of making inquiries, primarily of persons responsible for financial and accounting matters, and applying analytical and other review procedures. A review is substantially less in scope than an auditconducted in accordance with Sri Lanka Auditing Standards and consequently does not enable me to obtain assurance that I would become aware of all significant matters that might be identified in an audit.Accordingly, I do not express an audit opinion.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      112.76,
      162.03,
      121.06,
      198.75
    ],
    "text": "Conclusion",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.76,
      162.03,
      109.06,
      641.33
    ],
    "text": "Based on my review, nothing has come to my attention that causes me to believe that the accompanying Balance Sheet is not prepared, in all material respects.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.88,
      48.03,
      94.18,
      748.35
    ],
    "text": "W. P. C. Wickramaratne, Auditor General.National Audit Office,06th December, 2019.",
